            "title": "Why UWM Holdings (UWMC) Is Up 20.0% After Trump\u2019s US$200 Billion MBS Push And Two Harbors Deal",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "In recent days, UWM Holdings has been in focus after President Donald Trump ordered a US$200 billion purchase of mortgage-backed securities through Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac to counter the Federal Reserve\u2019s balance-sheet runoff and support lower mortgage rates. At the same time, UWM is pursuing a US$1.30 billion all-stock acquisition of Two Harbors Investment Corp., a deal that would significantly expand its mortgage servicing footprint and increase the proportion of loans it services...",
